                  }
                ],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "Target two Expeditions and create a [WOOLLYBACK] Animal token in each one. Then, each Character with Hand Cost {1} or less gains [ASLEEP]. (During Dusk, ignore their statistics. During Rest, they don't go to Reserve and lose Asleep.)",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "Scegli come bersaglio due spedizioni e crea una pedina Animale [WOOLLYBACK] in ciascuna. Poi, ogni personaggio con costo dalla mano pari o inferiore a {1} ottiene [ASLEEP]. (Durante il crepuscolo, ignora le loro statistiche. Durante il riposo, non vanno nella Riserva e perdono Dormiente.)",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Haz objetivo a dos expediciones y crea una ficha de animal [WOOLLYBACK] en cada una de ellas. Luego, cada personaje con coste desde la mano de {1} o menos gana [ASLEEP]. (Durante el anochecer, ignora sus estadísticas. Durante el descanso, no van a la reserva y pierden sueño.)",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Wähle zwei Expeditionen und erschaffe eine [WOOLLYBACK]-Tiermarke in jeder von ihnen. Dann erhält jeder Charakter mit Handkosten {1} oder weniger [ASLEEP]. (Am Abend ignoriere ihre Statistiken. Während der Ruhepause gehen sie nicht in die Reserve und verlieren Schlafend.)",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "Ciblez deux Expéditions et créez un jeton Animal [WOOLLYBACK] dans chacune d'elles. Puis, chaque Personnage de Coût de Main {1} ou moins gagne [ASLEEP]. (Pendant le Crépuscule, ignorez leurs statistiques. Au Repos, ils ne vont pas en Réserve et ils perdent Endormi.)",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  }
                },
                "text": "Target two Expeditions and create a [WOOLLYBACK] Animal token in each one. Then, each Character with Hand Cost {1} or less gains [ASLEEP]. (During Dusk, ignore their statistics. During Rest, they don't go to Reserve and lose Asleep.)"
              }
            ],
